# Data license — ODbL v1.0

The registry data in [`data/entities/`](data/entities/) and all files derived
from it (`registry.geojson`, `registry.csv`, `search.json`, `coverage.json`)
are made available under the **Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0**:
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1.0/

Summary (not a substitute for the license text):

- **Share**: you may copy, distribute and use the data freely.
- **Adapt**: you may create derivative databases and products from it.
- **Attribute**: you must credit this project and its data sources.
- **Share-alike**: if you publicly release a derived database, it must also
  be offered under the ODbL.

## Required attribution

When using or redistributing the data, include a notice such as:

> Data source: [ro-edu-registry](https://github.com/DynoW/ro-edu-registry)
> (ODbL), built from [admitere.edu.ro](https://admitere.edu.ro) and
> [© OpenStreetMap contributors](https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright)
> (ODbL).

